            <ArticleTitle>Detection of sclerosing adenosis of the breast on a thallium scan.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>277-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Uptake of thallium in a patient with sclerosing adenosis of the breast was detected. Although thallium has been reported to accumulate in primary carcinoma of the thyroid, lung, and liver, detection of a breast lesion on a thallium scan has not been previously reported.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
